  "notes": [
    "Retrieval uses the explicit-token corpus already frozen for TF-IDF/BM25 evidence.",
    "Baseline retrieval treats metadata field clauses as filters and scores only non-field, non-prohibited lexical query terms.",
    "Fielded BM25F retrieval uses explicit field specs and remains limited to the committed fielded smoke corpus.",
    "External qrels are limited to the committed BEIR NFCorpus title-token subset and do not prove broad retrieval quality.",
    "Streaming retrieval is package-level deterministic iteration over the same in-memory index semantics as batch retrieval.",
    "Citation windows and quote grounding use textdoc token spans when available and declare token-join loss otherwise."
  ]
